      "- Is your Google Business Profile fully claimed and verified, with owner-level access?\n- Does your business Name, Address, and Phone number match exactly across your profile, website, and directories?\n- Is your primary category the most specific accurate description of your business, not the broadest one?\n- Have you added real photos recently, not just once when the profile was first created?\n- Are you actively asking satisfied customers for reviews and responding to the ones you get?\n- Does your website mention your specific area/neighborhood naturally, with an embedded map and NAP in the footer?",
